# The granted ability is the land's (CR 113.7a, 608.2): Bot2's Strip Mine targets the enchanted Mountain, and Bot1 responds by
# tapping it to activate the ability on its Ornithopter. The Mountain is destroyed, the Aura - enchanting nothing - is put into
# the graveyard (CR 704.5m), and the ability still resolves, so the Ornithopter ends the turn with trample and haste.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Footfall Crater
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Strip Mine
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Footfall Crater.Cast(Mountain)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Strip Mine.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Strip Mine.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain; Ability: Destroy)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate(Ornithopter; Ability: trample)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Footfall Crater; Mountain
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying; Haste; Trample
